# Raw reference photos — uploaded to Cloudinary, not version-controlled.
# Cloudinary holds the canonical signed-access copy; the dossier.yaml's
# `reference_photos` array carries the durable URL reference.
#
# See README.md in this folder for the upload workflow.

*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.png
*.webp
*.JPG
*.JPEG
*.PNG
*.WEBP
*.heic
*.HEIC

# But DO commit the YAML, README, and this file itself.
!*.yaml
!*.md
!.gitignore
